      "handoutHtml": "<div class=\"g-card\" data-search=\"专项零 简单句 否定句 一般疑问句 特殊疑问句 助动词 do does did 陈述语序 倒装\">\n  <h3>四、简单句变否定/疑问与“陈述语序”底层原理</h3>\n  <div class=\"two-col\">\n    <div class=\"mini-box\">\n      <strong>规则 1：句中自带 <code>be</code> 动词、助动词（<code>have/will</code>）或情态动词（<code>can/must/should</code>）</strong>\n      <p>• 变否定：直接在其后加 <code><span class=\"cloze fnd-cloze\" data-fnd=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" title=\"点击显示/遮罩答案\">not</span></code>（<code>She is not late. / He cannot swim.</code>）<br>\n      • 变疑问：直接把该词<strong>提到主语前面</strong>（<code>Is she late? / Can he swim?</code>）</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mini-box\">\n      <strong>规则 2：句中只有实义动词（<code>work / works / worked</code>）</strong>\n      <p>• 必须请助动词 <code><span class=\"cloze fnd-cloze\" data-fnd=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" title=\"点击显示/遮罩答案\">do / does / did</span></code> 出山帮忙！<br>\n      • <strong>铁律：</strong>助动词把三单或过去时扛走后，后面的实义动词必须立刻<strong>打回原形 <code><span class=\"cloze fnd-cloze\" data-fnd=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" title=\"点击显示/遮罩答案\">do</span></code></strong>！<br>\n      <span class=\"eg\">例：<code>He went home.</code> ➔ 否定：<code>He didn't go home.</code> ➔ 疑问：<code>Where did he go?</code></span></p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"callout warn\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">\n    <strong>🔗 打通第五次课「宾语从句陈述语序」的钥匙：</strong><br>\n    • 单独提问时（特殊疑问句）：助动词提前，后面还原形 ➔ <code>Where <strong>did he buy</strong> the book?</code><br>\n    • 放进主句当宾语从句时（不再是独立问号，收回助动词 <code>did</code>，把过去时还给实义动词！）：<br>\n    ➔ <code>I want to know where <strong><span class=\"cloze fnd-cloze\" data-fnd=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" title=\"点击显示/遮罩答案\">he bought</span></strong> the book.</code>（这就是为什么宾语从句不能选 <code>did he buy</code>！）\n  </div>\n</div>",
